𗴂𗹭𗂧𘜶𘍞𗃛𗉔𗿣𗿷𗽔𘗣𗗙𘐆𘝞.content:
{{header
 | title    ={{Tangut|𗴂𗹭𗂧𘜶𘍞𗃛𗉔𗿣𗿷𗽔𘗣𗗙𘐆𘝞}} (''Record of the Spiritual Pagoda at Liángzhōu in the Great Kingdom of the White and Lofty'')
 | author   = 
 | section  = 
 | previous = 
