 | notes    = The Tangut text of the bilingual (Chinese and Tangut) stele which was erected on the 15th day of the 1st month of the 5th year of the Tiānyòu Mín'ān 天祐民安 era (3rd February 1094 in the Julian calendar) in commemoration of repairs to a pagoda that once stood in the grounds of the Hùguó Temple (護國寺 Hùguósì) in Liángzhōu 涼州 (modern Wǔwēi 武威 in Gānsù). [[:File:Liangzhou stele Tangut rubbing.jpg|Rubbing of the Tangut inscription on the Liángzhōu bilingual stele]]. Transcription based on Nishida 1964.
