𗼃𘝯𘝵𗦳𘜶𗈁𗤶𗄊𗧯𗣩𘉐𗖰𗖵𗰖.content:
{{header
 | title    ={{Tangut|𗼃𘝯𘝵𗦳𘜶𗈁𗤶𗄊𗧯𗣩𘉐𗖰𗖵𗰖}} (''Mahākāruṇika-nāma-ārya-avalokiteśvara dhāraṇī'')
 | author   = 
 | section  = 
 | previous = 
 | next     = 
 | notes    = Tangut version of the Sanskrit ''Mahākāruṇika-nāma-ārya-avalokiteśvara dhāraṇī''. The almost complete text of this ''dhāraṇī'' is preserved in a number of manuscript and woodblock printed fragments held at the [[:w:British Library|British Library]] (Or. 12380/2950; Or. 12380/2951; Or. 12380/3549 (e); Or. 12380/3690 (g, h, j, k, l, p, q, r, t, u, cc, dd, ee, ff, gg, ii); Or. 12380/3704 (b); Or. 12380/3707; Or. 12380/3728; Or. 12380/3740); [[w:Institute of Oriental Manuscripts of the Russian Academy of Sciences|Institute of Oriental Manuscripts]] (Tang 109/2, Inv. No. 4078; Tang 109/1, Inv. No. 7592); [[:w:Tenri Central Library|Tenri Central Library]] (39–30c; 39–31a); and Inner Mongolia Museum ([[:File:Inner Mongolia Museum Tangut dharani 2 Section A.jpg|M11·005]]). The transcription is based on the version given in Duàn 2014, with the corresponding Sanskrit text added by Duàn for reference.
}}


[[File:Inner Mongolia Museum Tangut dharani 2 Section A.jpg|thumb|right|600px|Woodblock printed text with the final part of {{Tangut|𗼃𘝯𘝵𗦳𘜶𗈁𗤶𗄊𗧯𗣩𘉐𗖰𗖵𗰖}} (M11·005)]]

{{Tangut|[𗙫　𘀍𘓩　𘃜𘎤𘀍　𘎤𘃜𘋮<small>𗓌</small>𗗔]<ref>The start of the ''dhāraṇī'' is not preserved in any of the surviving fragments, and has been reconstructed by Duàn Yùquán. Duàn gives {{Tangut|𗹀𘎤𘀍}} for ''ratna'', but the first character ({{Tangut|𗹀}}) cannot transcribe ''ra'', so has been corrected to {{Tangut|𘃜}}.</ref>　𘀍𘓩　𗠝𘙇𘋮　𗠝<small>𗓌</small>𘎧𗥹𘎫}}

''oṃ namo ratna-trayāya. nama āryāvaloki-''


{{Tangut|𘆨𗮞𘃜<small>𗓌</small>𘁂　𗿋𗤂𘅄𗸢<small>𗓌</small>𘁂　𗏵𗶴　𘅄𗸢𘁂　𗏵𗶴<small>𗓌</small>　𘊾𘏘𗐱𘊾<small>𗓌</small>𘁂}}

''teśvarāya, bodhisattvāya mahā-sattvāya mahā-kāruṇikāya''


{{Tangut|𘈪𗿿𗏤<small>𗓌</small>　𗙫　𘅄𗬂　𗍣𘃕𘀍　𘒋𗌽𘀍　𘊾𘃜<small>𗓌</small>𘁂　𘅄𗬂　𗴟<small>𗓌</small>𗴟}}

''tadyathā, oṃ sarva-bhadhana chedaṇa-karāya sarva-bhāva''


{{Tangut|𘅄𘓩𗌽𘃜　𗖱𗘊𘛣𘀍　𘊾𘃜<small>𗓌</small>𘁂　𘅄𗬂𗯱<small>𗓌</small>𗑓𗟱<small>𘃜</small>𘛣𗏵𘀍　𘊾𘃜<small>𗓌</small>𘁂}}

''samudra ucchośaṇa karāya. sarvavyādhi praśamana karāya.''


{{Tangut|𘅄𗬂　𗖽𘆨𗖱𗴟　𗌽<small>𘃜</small>𘎧　𗩤𘀍𘛣𘀍𘊾𘃜<small>𗓌</small>𘁂　𘅄𗬂𗍣𗗟𘊇}}

''sarva ityupa-drava vinaśanakarāya. sarva-bhayeṣu''


{{Tangut|𘎤<small>𘃜</small>𘀍<small>𗓌</small>𘁂　𘈪𗡱　𘀍𗏵𗸹𘙌𗣀𘈪<small>𘉑</small>　𗖛𗞞<small>𘉑</small>　𗠝<small>𘉑</small>𘙇𘋮　𗠝𘎧𗥹𘎫𘄿}}

''trāṇāya tasyu namaskṛtvā i dam ārya-avalokite-''


{{Tangut|𗮞𘃜𘈪𘎧　𗐱𗥰𗙪𗲤　𘀍𗏵　𗸔<small>𘜘</small>𗞞𘓾　𗠝<ref>Text up to this point is based on British Library Or. 12380/3740.</ref>𘎧𘙇𘈪𗗟　𘛣<small>𗓌</small>𗘺𘅄𗬂}}

''śvara tava, nīlakaṇṭha, namo hṛdayam āvartayi-ṣyāmi, sarva-''


{{Tangut|𗠝𘙇𗏤　𘅄𗞞𘀍　𘞐𗍣　𗥤𘈪𘀍　𘅄𗬂𘅄𗸢𘀍<small>𘉑</small>　𗴟𗴟　𗏵𘙇𘕜}}

''artha sādhanaṃ śubhaṃ cittana sarva-sattvanāṃ bhāva-m arga-''


{{Tangut|𗩤𗄈𗞞𘊾　𘈪𗿿𗏤<small>𗓌</small>　𗠝𘎧𗥹𘎫　𗥹𘊾𗏵𘆨<ref>Text up to this point is based on British Library Or. 12380/3690 (dd).</ref>　𗥹𘊾𘕜𘆨　𗖛𗙕𘍨}}

''viśuddhakaṃ tadyathā, āvaloke loka-mati lokāgati ehyehi''


{{Tangut|𗏵𗶴<small>𗓌</small>　𗿋𗤂𘅄𗸢　𗙕　𗿋𗤂𘅄𗸢　𗙕𗏵𗶴<small>𗓌</small>　𗿋𗤂𘅄𗸢　𗙕𗟱𘙇𘁂}}

''mahā bodhisattvā, he bodhisattvā he mahā bodhisattvā he priya''


{{Tangut|𗿋𗤂𘅄𗸢　𗙕𘊾𘏘𗐱𘊾<ref>Text up to this point is based on British Library Or. 12380/3690 (cc).</ref>　𗸹<small>𗏵</small>𘃜　𗸔𘜘𗞞𘓾<ref>Or. 12380/3690 (cc) has {{Tangut|𘁂}} instead of {{Tangut|𘓾}}.</ref>　𗖛𗙕𘍨　𗠝𘙇𘋮　𗠝𘎧}}

